e we see viserys on the throne and  someone riding a dragon in front of the  dragon pit the building that houses the  dragons we actually saw the dragonpit in  season 7 of game of thrones now there  are a few dragons in this trailer i'm  not going to get into too much detail  about them as there's still huge debate  online of which dragon is which and  who's riding who here we have a guarded  escort arriving and what i think is  king's landing you can make out what  appears to be house targaryen banners  over here this was actually filmed in  trujillo spain where the statue has been  replaced with that of a dragons at a  meeting of the small council king  viserys which you can tell by his ring  here puts what appears to be some sort  of token used for voting other members  of the council have their own too  however it looks like viserys is the  only white one sir otto hindtower  reminds the king the importance of  choosing his successor otto will become  an antagonist in damon's quest for the  throne if you look closely you'll also  see rhaenyra here serving the men  refreshments here we have a better view  of that jousting tournament we saw  glimpses of earlier not gonna lie  damon's get up here looks pretty badass  a young rhaenyra watches on we'll later  see her alongside her future husband  leonard valarion in the books it's  hinted that he's gay which may implies  this isn't the happiest of marriages  during the council meeting we hear otto  say that viserys's firstborn should have  a claim to the throne but it's lionel  strong lord of harrenhal who reminds him  that a woman has never sat on the throne  it's coreless velaryon elena's father  and head of house velaryon that says the  king already has an heir and that's  daemon targaryen this puts the king in a  tough spot and he doesn't want to choose  between his brother and daughter damon  looks to have several loyal members of  the city watch also known as the gold  cloaks damon commanded the watch from  104 