f to be  that rightful heir back at dragonstone  we have a better glimpse of that  confrontation between daemon and serato  damon is holding a dragon egg here and  to his left we can make out messaria  confidante and daemon's unofficial  mistress rhaenyra asks cole if he thinks  the realm will accept her as their queen  which is followed by uranus telling  renera that no woman will ever be on the  throne because that is the order of  things there's this brilliant cut to  older rhaenyra telling us that when  she's queen she will then create a new  order we get a couple of shots of damon  in the aftermath of a great battle this  could be one of two things the war of  the stepstones which saw damon team up  with corliss velaryon to take on the  triarchy in an attempt to gain his own  kingdom or the battle of the gullet one  of the bloodiest sea battles in  westerosi history which occurred during  the dance of dragons a shot of a heated  dragon egg is accompanied by voice over  of viserys that dragons are a power man  should have never trifled with looks  like damon is not heeding his brother's  words here damon sues karaxis and i  gotta say it looks damn good this closer  shot even looks like it could be part  practical here we have what appears to  be aemond targaryen claiming his dragon  vagar and apologies if i get some of  these pronunciations wrong eamond is the  second son of king viserys and alicent  hightower this is set in an alcove  overlooking some water as a dragon spews  fire it reminds me of a pirate's cove  with miscellaneous treasure tossed to  the side if you zoom in on the man here  it appears to be the same masked guy  we'll see later this is likely crab  feeder who's an antagonist in daemon's  war of the stepstones here's a shot of  alicent and rhaenyra notice the  differing green and black dresses in the  books greens vs blacks becomes a common  way of referring to the queens and  princesses parties respectively alison  warns what may be her son aegon looking  like he just came home from a brothel  that if renera comes into power she can  cut off any challenge to her secession  meaning kill aegon and his siblings it  might be possible this could be her  daughter helena more shots of the gold  cloaks cheering on damon and renera  talking to damon about how alicent will  block her way to the throne we get this  shot of a crown on top of what could be  the dead body of the king here we have  cole fighting aymond and these two great  shots of younger allicent and rhaenyra  juxtaposed with their older selves  highlighting how they once were close  but drifted apart here's corliss running  into battle where you can see the  seahorse emblem on his helm this appears  to be from that same battle we saw  earlier alison cries likely as she finds  out her husband will soon be dead which  is followed by reynus asking her if she  ever imagined herself on the iron throne  a shot of a dragon coming over the walls  at dragonstone with sir otto and his  cohort in the foreground here we have a  knight representing house baratheon at  the tournament perhaps boors or bormond  followed by the valarians entering a  feast more aftermath of that battle with  tons of crabs skittering around not  exactly sure who this guy is brutally  finishing someone off is it crab feeder  or someone else he appears to be  wielding a hammer damon also holds a  hammer while bending the knee to viserys  perhaps it's a victory token of his  defeat of crab feeder this looks to be  from that same battle you can see the  beach over to the right with what could  be the dragon's sea smoke blasting away  at the enemy below this looks to be  viserys and a young allison if you look  closely she might be pregnant another  shot of daemon as part of the city watch  and alison stealing a dagger to attack  rhaenyra this might be alison's exacting  revenge on rhaenyra rhaenyra's son  lucerus slashed the eye of allison's son  eamonn this wide shot gives us a better  look at what might be happening on the  top right we can make it what seems to  be viserys on the ground holding a cane  he's probably sick at this point and  maybe it was his dagger that alison  stole damon and cole seemed to be at it  over here with harold telling them to  knock it off and corliss protects his  family to the left viserys seems to be  getting it on with someone maybe his  niece renera who he'll later wed here's  a shot of karaxis with what appears to  be a saddle around his neck and the  final shot is of a dragon with green  eyes here likely cyrox and that's where  the trailer leaves us now there's only  one more month before house of the  dragon comes out i'll be giving the book  another read in the meantime but you can  help me out by liking and subscribing  and leaving a comment on what you think  of this prequel stick around till then  because i'll be breaking down every  episode of the season thanks for  watching

